t=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfssZ5xKFFDDufb6brfCV8Yl1GEp7YkDaeS0r-4d0QqYag&oe=69A05537"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GmR5WvRZhiYQ7kNvwE_Dxtr&_nc_oc=AdnNBqSKJKEAaoqnQVPdoKO0pHXxosFBoeq7lBl3_78aZFTVACn3qFo5SURQAXe5XPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftKFurs29Ltg7Y7uH-VbRdYcWuSUYdtL8EzumusX8-eGg&oe=69A056CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ucwpv9gFtOMQ7kNvwH2bsoC&_nc_oc=AdnLKryQhgfg3IfbcWT_trHmtkWtxWo8BhLnB70TBte4OBXfUsifMJDMF7PgBILhq94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuoCRibVaQQ1l8OClJeZPRq1LVl55nMfaAO_Cq9GR3_uw&oe=69A043EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LozZy6B59JcQ7kNvwHjLJcX&_nc_oc=Adk-N43cfVSH0RF-PUb5zpiKXlBKUrmngQhozHB4xpo0EdJ8TVUdqOigmsWdx9nT7eM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu2_97Rz34iF-fJT3fCsNx48aUtps9HgfX_IBYSl6bTog&oe=69A02D43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ygU3KEvqMwYQ7kNvwEod3Kv&_nc_oc=Adn6Uiid1QdP4o2ICf881FP_okiBWk6um9EdDz1yb0NRJ9cdrl8fvBlO6SmPEdL8OSY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afujnvy9A5wJVxeuPVLza3XzEnZt38xA1xkkUsafe6XLEg&oe=69A02598"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nw0D_Fub4tsQ7kNvwEOsbBx&_nc_oc=AdkKApSD4aIbC9dqpVdVjpznJs93K1tK-E0OlQYcK5JlVR0HFbBxj-LRf4BfmsK0pyE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft1LWmUXBa84CbKMKiI33P0AsUi8y_JBLPSG6XNkkKBmQ&oe=69A038BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bzxgUsQAZSIQ7kNvwExGhjy&_nc_oc=AdlnR4O89fC9839eXqqd2jZ14o25gtyAUfF3F21TpOc3r7NMXTembqLDalpfUEsvl3g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=sco