t=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfssZ5xKFFDDufb6brfCV8Yl1GEp7YkDaeS0r-4d0QqYag&oe=69A05537"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GmR5WvRZhiYQ7kNvwE_Dxtr&_nc_oc=AdnNBqSKJKEAaoqnQVPdoKO0pHXxosFBoeq7lBl3_78aZFTVACn3qFo5SURQAXe5XPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftKFurs29Ltg7Y7uH-VbRdYcWuSUYdtL8EzumusX8-eGg&oe=69A056CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ucwpv9gFtOMQ7kNvwH2bsoC&_nc_oc=AdnLKryQhgfg3IfbcWT_trHmtkWtxWo8BhLnB70TBte4OBXfUsifMJDMF7PgBILhq94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuoCRibVaQQ1l8OClJeZPRq1LVl55nMfaAO_Cq9GR3_uw&oe=69A043EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running